          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">An incline trainer is a treadmill that climbs to around 40%.</strong>
            That range is invaluable for hikers and steep walkers, and an expensive, heavy, tall
            irrelevance for most runners and general-fitness walkers.
          </p>
